<title>USA: Mitsubishi October US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi October US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp</p>
<p>			Oct 1-31, 1996     Oct 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    11,071	     8,322	    +28.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck		 0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Car		 6,426	     6,679	     -7.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,691	     1,790	     -9.0</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Oct 31, 1996 Jan 1-Oct 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   107,398	    85,961	    +24.0</p>
<p> Domestic Truck		 0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Car		38,498	    66,791	    -42.8</p>
<p> Import Truck	    13,620	    19,054	    -29.1</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 27 in latest month vs 26, 258 for year to date vs 256 in year ago.</p>
